{"id":22296,"slug":"violence-at-noon","title":"Violence at Noon","year":1966,"country":"Japan","duration":98,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/22296-violence-at-noon","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/01eb6087c76182f8ed720ab1fd2b4a16/l7uFRaowcYuOLzlxLaCNKQC9x6PWCL_large.jpg","description":"Violence at Noon concerns the odd circumstances surrounding a horrific murder and rape spree. In a twist, the film is as much about the two women who protect the violent man—his wife and a former victim—as it is about him. Containing more than two thousand cuts and a wealth of inventive widescreen compositions, this coolly fragmented character study is a mesmerizing investigation of criminality and social decay. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Nagisa Oshima","slug":"nagisa-oshima"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Saeda Kawaguchi","role":"Shino Shinozaki","slug":"saeda-kawaguchi"},{"actor":"Kei Sato","role":"Eisuke Oyamada","slug":"kei-sato"},{"actor":"Akiko Koyama","role":"Matsuko Koura","slug":"akiko-koyama"},{"actor":"Rokko Toura","role":"Genji Hyuga","slug":"rokko-toura"},{"actor":"Taiji Tonoyama","role":"School director","slug":"taiji-tonoyama"},{"actor":"Fumio Watanabe","role":"Inspector Haraguchi","slug":"fumio-watanabe"},{"actor":"Teruko Kishi","role":"Shino’s grandmother","slug":"teruko-kishi"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Nagisa Oshima","slug":"nagisa-oshima"},{"role":"Cinematography","person":"Akira Takada","slug":null},{"role":"Editing","person":"Keiichi Uraoka","slug":null},{"role":"Music","person":"Hikaru Hayashi","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Masayuki Nakajima","slug":null},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Tsutomo Tamura","slug":null},{"role":"From the story by","person":"Taijun Takeda","slug":null},{"role":"Art direction","person":"Jusho Toda","slug":null}],"pickedBy":[],"related":[1288,1430,822],"setFilms":[],"inSets":[1000720]}